msgid "How to get started?"
msgstr "Hur kommer man igång?"

# Review: bf425262d2b7e6852179701f
# Evidence: https://crowdin.com/translate/freecad-addons/32152/en-sv-SE
# Evidence-SHA256: 1526ae6e4e631612819ad6e0679885d397fcfc03386cd8349e9a6bf349784abe
# Source-evidence: {"crowdin_file": "32152", "crowdin_unit": "6582164", "language": "sv-SE"}
# Publication: crowdin-imported
#. Review-note (JSON): "Radvis språkgranskad och importerad i Crowdin."
msgctxt "[\"FreeCAD Addons\",\"/Archive/BIM.ts\",\"Dialog\\n../dialogWelcome.ui:67\",\"32152:6582164\",\"bf425262d2b7e6852179701f\"]"
msgid "FreeCAD is a complex application. If this is your first contact with FreeCAD, or you have never worked with 3D or BIM before, you might want to take our <a href=\"https://www.freecadweb.org/wiki/BIM_Start_Tutorial\">BIM tutorial</a> first (Also available under menu <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Help -&gt; BIM Tutorial</span>)."
msgstr "FreeCAD är en komplex applikation. Om det här är din första kontakt med FreeCAD, eller om du aldrig har arbetat med 3D eller BIM tidigare, kanske du vill ta vår <a href=\"https://www.freecadweb.org/wiki/BIM_Start_Tutorial\">BIM-handledning</a> först (finns också under menyn <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Hjälp -&gt; BIM-handledning</span>)."

# Review: 522b22a46202660f7de2069b
# Evidence: https://crowdin.com/translate/freecad-addons/32152/en-sv-SE
# Evidence-SHA256: 1526ae6e4e631612819ad6e0679885d397fcfc03386cd8349e9a6bf349784abe
# Source-evidence: {"crowdin_file": "32152", "crowdin_unit": "6582166", "language": "sv-SE"}
# Publication: crowdin-imported
#. Review-note (JSON): "Radvis språkgranskad och importerad i Crowdin."
msgctxt "[\"FreeCAD Addons\",\"/Archive/BIM.ts\",\"Dialog\\n../dialogWelcome.ui:77\",\"32152:6582166\",\"522b22a46202660f7de2069b\"]"
msgid "The BIM workbench also has a <a href=\"https://wiki.freecadweb.org/BIM_Workbench\">complete documentation</a>  available under the Help menu. The \"what's this?\" button will also open the help page of any tool from the toolbars."
msgstr "BIM-arbetsbänken har också en <a href=\"https://wiki.freecadweb.org/BIM_Workbench\">fullständig dokumentation</a> tillgänglig under Hjälp-menyn. Knappen \"vad är det här?\" öppnar också hjälpsidan för alla verktyg från verktygsfälten."

# Review: a0b72c62f18409af6fffd158
# Evidence: https://crowdin.com/translate/freecad-addons/32152/en-sv-SE
# Evidence-SHA256: 1526ae6e4e631612819ad6e0679885d397fcfc03386cd8349e9a6bf349784abe
# Source-evidence: {"crowdin_file": "32152", "crowdin_unit": "6582168", "language": "sv-SE"}
# Publication: crowdin-imported
#. Review-note (JSON): "Radvis språkgranskad och importerad i Crowdin."
msgctxt "[\"FreeCAD Addons\",\"/Archive/BIM.ts\",\"Dialog\\n../dialogWelcome.ui:87\",\"32152:6582168\",\"a0b72c62f18409af6fffd158\"]"
msgid "A good way to start building a BIM model is by setting up basic characteristics of your project, under menu <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Manage -&gt; Project setup</span>. You can also directly configure different floor plans for your project, under menu <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Manage -&gt; Levels.</span>"
msgstr "Ett bra sätt att börja bygga en BIM-modell är att ställa in grundläggande egenskaper för ditt projekt under menyn <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Hantera -&gt; Projektkonfiguration</span>. Du kan också direkt konfigurera olika våningsplan för ditt projekt under menyn <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Hantera -&gt; Nivåer</span>."

# Review: 49249e8ab4383ce996668bb6
# Evidence: https://crowdin.com/translate/freecad-addons/32152/en-sv-SE
# Evidence-SHA256: 1526ae6e4e631612819ad6e0679885d397fcfc03386cd8349e9a6bf349784abe
# Source-evidence: {"crowdin_file": "32152", "crowdin_unit": "6580268", "language": "sv-SE"}
