# Review: 097865f8b5254a3348b96b88
# Evidence: https://crowdin.com/translate/freecad-addons/32152/en-sv-SE
# Evidence-SHA256: 1526ae6e4e631612819ad6e0679885d397fcfc03386cd8349e9a6bf349784abe
