msgid "Applicable for creating an animation from point A to B (not when the MovieCamera target or MovieObjects are set up to follow a route). Select and activate the MovieCamera or MovieObjects you want to configure. For MovieCameras, position the 3D view with the desired framing to be the end of the animation (position B), then click on Set position B. For MovieObjects, position and/or rotate them to the final position, then click on this button."
