msgid "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Bounding Box LIST:</span></p><p>configure which 3D models will be converted to Bounding Box</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Examples:</span></p><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">ALL</span><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">-&gt; all models will be converted to bounding boxes</span></p><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">LIST</span> DSUB-15-HD_FH, DSUB-9_FH <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">-&gt; these two models will NOT be converted to BBox</span></p><p><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">(list of 3D model's names separated by a semicolon)</span></p></body></html>"
