msgid "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Black List:</span></p><p>put here your model names that you don't want to load (e.g. smallest ones)</p><p>separated by a semicolon.</p><p>volume and height are also configurable.</p><p>(volume=1 means all models with a volume &lt; 1mm3 will not be included)</p><p>(height=1 means all models with a height &lt; 1mm will not be included)</p><p><br/><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Examples:</span></p><p>r_0603;r_0402;c_0402;c_0603</p><p>height=1.0</p><p>volume=1.0</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">An empty list means all the models will be parsed.</span></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Svartlista:</span></p><p>ange modellnamnen som du inte vill läsa in (t.ex. de minsta)</p><p>separerade med semikolon.</p><p>Volym och höjd kan också konfigureras.</p><p>(volym=1 innebär att alla modeller med en volym &lt; 1mm3 inte tas med)</p><p>(höjd=1 innebär att alla modeller med en höjd &lt; 1mm inte tas med)</p><p><br/><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Exempel:</span></p><p>r_0603;r_0402;c_0402;c_0603</p><p>height=1.0</p><p>volume=1.0</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">En tom lista innebär att alla modeller bearbetas.</span></p></body></html>"

