# Review: a4e0ad2bee359dadd8892abb
# Evidence: https://crowdin.com/translate/freecad-addons/32180/en-sv-SE
# Evidence-SHA256: 1526ae6e4e631612819ad6e0679885d397fcfc03386cd8349e9a6bf349784abe
# Source-evidence: {"crowdin_file": "32180", "crowdin_unit": "6639442", "language": "sv-SE"}
