msgid ""
"Update parts, which have been\n"
"imported to the assembly.\n"
"\n"
"(If you modify a part in an\n"
"external file, the new shape\n"
"is taken to the assembly by\n"
"this function).\n"
"\n"
"This command does this recursively\n"
"over all involved subassemblies.\n"
"\n"
"Subassemblies are updated,\n"
"if necessary, too."
msgstr ""
"Uppdatera delar som har\n"
"importerats till sammanställningen.\n"
"\n"
"(Om du ändrar en del i en\n"
"extern fil förs den nya formen\n"
"till sammanställningen med hjälp av\n"
"den här funktionen.)\n"
"\n"
"Detta kommando gör detta rekursivt\n"
"över alla inblandade underenheter.\n"
"\n"
"Underenheter uppdateras,\n"
"om det behövs, också."

