msgid ""
"Create the angular Axis-to-Plane constraint (AxisPlaneAngle)\n"
"\n"
"Select:\n"
"1) A linear edge, or cylinder/cone axis (on a part)\n"
"2) A plane face (on another part)\n"
"\n"
"At first this constraint adjusts an axis parallel to a\n"
"selected plane. Within the following popUp dialog you\n"
"can define an angle.\n"
"\n"
"The parts are not moved to be coincident."
msgstr ""
"Skapa den vinklade begränsningen för axel-till-plan (AxisPlaneAngle)\n"
"\n"
"Välj:\n"
"1) En linjär kant eller cylinder-/kegelaxel (på en detalj)\n"
"2) En plan yta (på en annan del)\n"
"\n"
"Till en början justerar denna constraint en axel parallellt med ett\n"
"valt plan. I följande popup-dialogruta kan du\n"
"kan du definiera en vinkel.\n"
"\n"
"Delarna flyttas inte så att de sammanfaller."

