"Create the Plane-Coincident constraint (PlaneCoincident)\n"
"\n"
"Select:\n"
"1) A plane (on a part)\n"
"2) A plane (on another part)\n"
"\n"
"It is possible to change the offset in object editor."
msgstr ""
"Skapa begränsningen Plane-Coincident (PlaneCoincident)\n"
"\n"
"Välj:\n"
"1) Ett plan (på en del)\n"
"2) Ett plan (på en annan del)\n"
"\n"
"Det är möjligt att ändra offset i objektredigeraren."

# Review: 52bfd6e5fa20bbef6b5e9727
# Evidence: https://crowdin.com/translate/freecad-addons/32198/en-sv-SE
