# Review: d965d534ac26dc1b3a10cf0c
# Evidence: https://crowdin.com/translate/freecad-addons/32214/en-sv-SE
# Evidence-SHA256: 1526ae6e4e631612819ad6e0679885d397fcfc03386cd8349e9a6bf349784abe
